大部分を占める | district cooling, refrigerant\n欧州 | 熱波頻度の上昇 | 従来は冷房普及率が低く、適応需要が増加 | adaptation, temperature rise"}], "run_at": "2026-07-26T08:16:15.635993+00:00", "run_id": "20260726-contract-smoke", "sequence_index": -1, "sequence_plan": "default", "signals": ["lexical"], "stage_timing_enabled": false, "status": "partial", "stderr_tail": "", "stdout_json_pure": true, "stdout_prefix": "{\n  \"schema\": \"local-rag.search.v1\",\n  \"db\": \"ac-rag\",\n  \"db_hint\": \"\",\n  \"query", "timed_out": false, "timeout_seconds": 30, "timings": {}, "top1_path": "sample_global_cooling_temperature_memo.docx", "top1_section": "sample_global_cooling_temperature_memo.docx", "top_k": 8, "unmatched_identifiers": ["A2W"], "warmup": true, "warmup_runs": 1, "warnings": ["Exact identifier match not found for: A2W. Returned evidence, if any, is related context and not proof of those identifiers."], "worktree_fingerprint": "8dcc5c0389406c220603eaf843a9ea7a2f3e6fd80a43fe2bcf7243a3b5f8f65b"}
